WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
On Home, choose Try without accounts.
The demonstration does not access music accounts.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.900
Review My first playlist.
It contains three occurrences, including an intentional repeat.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.400
Choose Review and transfer.
Read the summary and confirm Transfer 1 playlist.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.500
The result confirms three tracks added.
The repeat is preserved in the output file.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.700
Open History and the details.
Download the playlist or CSV and JSON reports.
